window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-094-34256c49ee3f6d16.json"]={sha256:"34256c49ee3f6d167acac1c41b73569e9fab0ce1b020a584fa004edf1e5d9dbd",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-7409e2acd490446b","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/managing-incidents/","title":"Google SRE Book: managing incidents","titleEn":"Google SRE Book: managing incidents","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-094","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-094","related":[{"id":"security-v27-095","referenceUrls":["https://sre.google/sre-book/being-on-call/"],"title":"Google SRE值班：事件後續工作與可持續負荷帳本","titleEn":"Google SRE on-call: follow-up work and sustainable load accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付incident-dag.json、role-handoff.csv、status-draft.txt及verification.json；保留開始、結束與等待原因，不僅記錄總耗時。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver incident-dag.json, role-handoff.csv, status-draft.txt and verification.json. Preserve task starts, finishes and waiting reasons rather than only a final duration, enabling independent review of the claimed improvement.","difference":"將合成事件分為即時處理與後續工作，逐件保存工時及負責人；比較自動化前後總負荷，不能把縮短接警時間等同消除事件成本。","differenceEn":"Separate immediate incident response from follow-up work and record hours and owner per synthetic event. Compare total workload before and after automation without equating faster acknowledgment with eliminated incident cost.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE事件管理使用清楚角色與共享事件狀態；本課平行性只在工作互不依賴且人員確實可用時成立，不把分工當成免費加速。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 分流4分鐘後，技術修復12分鐘與對外摘要7分鐘可平行；服務驗證5分鐘必須在修復後，最終交接需摘要與驗證都完成。 平行流程驗證完成4+12+5=21分鐘，摘要11分鐘完成；單人先摘要再修復再驗證共4+7+12+5=28。","SRE值班實務重視可持續工作量與工程改善；本課40小時分母及工作時間均為教學假設，並非所有組織的工時標準或人力建議。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 一個合成週可用工程時間40小時；10件事件各即時處理1小時、後續1.5小時，無重疊工時計入，其他工作暫排除。 完整事件工時10×(1+1.5)=25小時，占62.5%；只計即時處理會報10小時、25%，漏掉15小時。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE incident management uses clear roles and shared incident state. Parallelism here is valid only where tasks are independent and assigned people are actually available; delegation is not assumed to provide free acceleration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. After four minutes of triage, remediation takes twelve and the communication summary seven, independently. Service verification takes five after remediation; final handoff requires both summary and verification to finish. The parallel workflow verifies service at 4+12+5=21 minutes, with summary ready at eleven. One person completing summary, remediation and verification serially takes 4+7+12+5=28 minutes.","SRE on-call practice emphasizes sustainable workload and engineering improvement. The forty-hour denominator and task durations are teaching assumptions, not a universal workweek standard or staffing recommendation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. A synthetic week provides forty engineering hours. Ten incidents each require one immediate-response hour and 1.5 follow-up hours, counted without overlapping person-hours; other work is excluded from this fixture. Total incident work is 10×(1+1.5)=25 hours, or 62.5%. Counting only response would report ten hours and 25%, omitting fifteen hours of required follow-up.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-004","referenceUrls":["https://docs.aws.amazon.com/rolesanywhere/latest/userguide/attribute-mapping-and-trust-policy.html"],"title":"IAM Roles Anywhere：憑證屬性映射與信任錨限定","titleEn":"IAM Roles Anywhere: certificate attribute mapping and trust-anchor scoping","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付incident-dag.json、role-handoff.csv、status-draft.txt及verification.json；保留開始、結束與等待原因，不僅記錄總耗時。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver incident-dag.json, role-handoff.csv, status-draft.txt and verification.json. Preserve task starts, finishes and waiting reasons rather than only a final duration, enabling independent review of the claimed improvement.","difference":"以十份合成憑證描述檔列trust anchor、issuer CN、subject OU及映射後標籤；寫出需要指定錨及指定OU的政策表，保留缺值為缺值。","differenceEn":"Tabulate trust anchor, issuer CN, subject OU and mapped tags for ten synthetic certificate descriptors. Define required anchor and OU conditions, explicitly preserving absent values.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE事件管理使用清楚角色與共享事件狀態；本課平行性只在工作互不依賴且人員確實可用時成立，不把分工當成免費加速。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 分流4分鐘後，技術修復12分鐘與對外摘要7分鐘可平行；服務驗證5分鐘必須在修復後，最終交接需摘要與驗證都完成。 平行流程驗證完成4+12+5=21分鐘，摘要11分鐘完成；單人先摘要再修復再驗證共4+7+12+5=28。","本課兩個profile皆採固定AND條件：指定錨ArnEquals、OU StringEquals、CN StringEquals。缺少CN使這個StringEquals條件不成立；此結論不能推廣到StringNotEquals等其他IAM運算子。 十筆中8筆符合錨限制，6筆同時具有正確OU與CN標籤；這6筆中的2筆使用profile-A、4筆使用profile-B。變更僅移除profile-A的issuerCN映射，兩個profile的政策條件完全不變。 原始通過率6/10×100=60%；缺少所需映射後4/10×100=40%。這是固定fixture覆蓋統計，不是AWS實際允許率。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE incident management uses clear roles and shared incident state. Parallelism here is valid only where tasks are independent and assigned people are actually available; delegation is not assumed to provide free acceleration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. After four minutes of triage, remediation takes twelve and the communication summary seven, independently. Service verification takes five after remediation; final handoff requires both summary and verification to finish. The parallel workflow verifies service at 4+12+5=21 minutes, with summary ready at eleven. One person completing summary, remediation and verification serially takes 4+7+12+5=28 minutes.","Both profiles use fixed AND conditions: the designated anchor with ArnEquals, plus OU and CN with StringEquals. Missing CN makes this selected equality condition fail. Do not generalize that behavior to StringNotEquals or every IAM operator. Eight of ten rows pass anchor restrictions and six also have correct OU and CN tags. Two of these six use profile-A and four use profile-B. Only profile-A loses its issuerCN mapping; policy conditions remain fixed for both profiles. Baseline fixture pass rate is 6/10×100=60%; the changed mapping gives 4/10×100=40%. These are local test outcomes, not an observed AWS authorization rate.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-121ad2356e8597a4","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/being-on-call/","title":"Google SRE Book: being on-call","titleEn":"Google SRE Book: being on-call","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-02fefa76cfae588f","url":"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/rolesanywhere/latest/userguide/attribute-mapping-and-trust-policy.html","title":"IAM Roles Anywhere attribute mapping and trust policy","titleEn":"IAM Roles Anywhere attribute mapping and trust policy","publisher":"AWS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
